WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Which skill should I use? Keep the recommendation with the team.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A public source becomes a team recommendation with its context attached.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Alex starts from a public repository or skill URL. Skills Board reads its valid SKILL.md.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Alex adds a team note, an example prompt, and tags.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.500
Alex saves it. Sam can find it in the shared team library.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Sam searches the library and finds Alex's recommendation with its context intact.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Sam copies a compatible path while the original source stays visible.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Save once. Find fast. Use it your way. Create your team library at skillsboard.sh.
